# Comware V5 transceiver digital diagnostic values.
Value Filldown INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required TEMPERATURE (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value Required VOLTAGE (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value Required BIAS (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value Required RX_POWER (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value Required TX_POWER (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+transceiver\s+diagnostic\s+information:\s*$$
  ^\s*Current\s+diagnostic\s+parameters:\s*$$
  ^\s*Temp\([^)]*\)\s+Voltage\(V\)\s+Bias\(mA\)\s+RX\s+power\(dBm\)\s+TX\s+power\(dBm\)\s*$$
  ^\s*${TEMPERATURE}\s+${VOLTAGE}\s+${BIAS}\s+${RX_POWER}\s+${TX_POWER}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$

